# Add a `grep` tool with a max-results flag

## Symptom

The agent reads whole files to find one symbol.

## Reproduction

```
anvil run "find callers of foo"
```

## Spec

Tool `grep` with `pattern`, `path`, `max_results` (default 50) in anvil-core.

## Acceptance

- [ ] cargo test -p anvil-core passes
- [ ] the tool schema snapshot is updated

Add or update tests for every acceptance item; do not touch files outside the crates the spec names unless a shared type in anvil-types must change, and if so say why in the PR body.

